2,Shwai language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639:shw,"November 1, 2025 - Shwai (Shuway) is a Niger–Congo language in the Heiban family spoken in South Kordofan, Sudan. It is also called Ludumor.",Shwai,Niger-Congo
